<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Napier was 418 NZ cents per kg clean versus 424 at the previous pril 17, Wools of New Zealand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - n/a vs n/a</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - n/a vs 565</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 354 vs 360</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 402 vs 397</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
